I had the correct answer from the first posting.  My problem was from ICMP 
redirects not RIP.  Since I was not running gated or routed RIP was out of 
the picture.

The problem was with the directions for changing the kernel value.  It 
should be:


dbx  -k /vmunix
(dbx)p icmp_rejectcodemask
0
(dbx)patch icmp_rejectcodemask=32
32
(dbx)quit

This does not require any extra Developement licences.

Thanx again

tim
bairdtimothy@hotmail.com


<><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><



