	During my summary I mentioned that upon rebooting our system the computer 
had somehow dropped into AlphaBIOS mode and the difficulties of getting it 
out of this and back into the SMR console.  My thanks to the three people 
who sent me a surprise reply telling me that its probably due to a flat 
motherboard battery.  Logically, when the motherboard looses power, all the 
firmware settings are reset to the defaults which includes the AlphaBIOS 
bootup.

	Easy enough to fix :)

