Thanks for prompt answers:

Mine question was:
> Hi all,
>
> I have one small question. When I'm trying to run on DU V4.0D
> dxaccounts, I'm getting following messeage:
>
> The password and group files are currently locked by another user.
> Please try again later.
>
> But nobody is currently using it. Do you now where is located that lock
> file, or what shell I do?
>
> Thanks for your help.
