Thanks to Bob Klenotiz and Peter Stern for two quick replies on this.

I posted about a KZPAC-XF and BA356-RA, wondering if this combo
would support RZ1DF-VW (9.1GB) disks.

Here are the responses.
--------------------------
Yes, you can use 9GB disks, but keep in mind that the KZPAC controller
has a limit of 32GB of user addressable space per logical drive.
--------------------------
The KZPAC will work with 9.1GB drives. I have 23 systems using them right
now...
--------------------------

Thanks again!

Judith Reed

