Subject: SUMMARY: Re: Is it possible to run Tru64 on an Alpha Server 7305?
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=97848332326322

 Original question:
> I would like to know if it is possible to install/run Tru64 5.1 on a Alpha
> Server 7305.

Answers range from NO to YES...

Everyone who replied agreed that the following are known to be true.
1. Need fully functional (bootable) SRM console.
2. All devices would need to be supported. graphics, scsi controllers, etc.
3. This is not a Compaq supported configuration.

I knew those to be true, I was really trying to find out if Tru64 would
install onto the (base) system, assuming 1 & 2 above where met.  One other
person, not on this list, said he knows of someone who has done this,
